nting. Limb (d) did hold (you terminated under RIDER_NO_SHOW with no boarding event), which is why no reason-code mis-selection referral is made; the only referral is the false-arrival record POL-NS-05(ii) requires. The driver-pressed BUTTON marker means POL-NS-12's platform-confirmed-arrival shortcut does not apply, as both sides accept. On escalation: none of POL-NS-09's triggers fires. Confidence is not below 0.70; the only apparent conflict (the arrival tap against a trace placing you 647.5 m away) is resolved by POL-NS-05, not left open; both disputes_with_counterparty_90d counters are 0 and rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0; the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip (1 no-show termination in 30 days against 66 completed trips, about 0.015, against a threshold of 4 and 0.08); and every artifact carrying a deciding fact is COMPLETE at weight 1.0, so no POL-NS-08 impairment engages POL-NS-09(e). The missing advisory EV-ADVIS-03203-01 (weight 0.0) carries no fact - it is cited only for its absence, which makes POL-NS-06(i) accumulation unavailable to the driver - and it does not cap confidence because it carries none of the deciding facts. Confidence 0.95: the deciding fact (the driver's position) rests on EV-GPS-03203 and EV-TRIP-03203, both weight 1.0 and COMPLETE, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0. The monetary effect of SGD 4.50 is below the POL-GEN-05 execution_threshold_sgd of SGD 8.00, so this provisional ruling executes automatically. On the driver's POL-GEN-01 point: the rating, acceptance rate, account age and lifetime trip count were treated as context only and carried no finding."
